## 5. Checklist – Did you cover everything?

| ✅ | Item | What to verify |
|---|------|----------------|
| 1 | **Package** | `npm uninstall mapbox-gl && npm install maplibre-gl` (or CDN update). |
| 2 | **Imports / CSS** | `import * as maplibregl from 'maplibre-gl';` and `import 'maplibre-gl/dist/maplibre-gl.css';` |
| 3 | **Namespace** | All `mapboxgl` → `maplibregl` (including class names, e.g., `new maplibregl.Marker()`). |
| 4 | **Access token** | Remove any `mapboxgl.accessToken = …` line. |
| 5 | **Style URL** | Use a non-Mapbox style (`https://tiles.openfreemap.org/...`, your own style JSON, or a hosted third-party style). |
| 6 | **Fog → Sky** | Replace every `map.setFog(...)` (or `style.fog`) with `map.setSky(...)` and add a top-level `"sky"` object to the style if you prefer static configuration. |
| 7 | **Free-camera** | Replace `getFreeCameraOptions` / `setFreeCameraOptions` with the `calculateCameraOptionsFrom…` helper + `jumpTo/easeTo/flyTo`. |
| 8 | **Plugins** | Verify any Mapbox-specific plugins have MapLibre equivalents (or are still compatible). |
| 9 | **Mapbox APIs** | Swap Geocoding, Directions, etc., for open alternatives (Nominatim, OSRM, etc.) if you used them. |
|10| **Testing** | Load the map, check that controls appear (`.maplibregl-ctrl` CSS), verify the sky appears, and confirm the camera moves as expected. |

If you tick all the boxes above, the migration is complete.

